{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09268","headline":"登蒲塘驿沿路见泉谷邨墅忽想京师旧居追怀昔年 · 韦应物","name":"登蒲塘驿沿路见泉谷邨墅忽想京师旧居追怀昔年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山导骑遶，春风行斾舒。\n均徭视属城，问疾躬里闾。\n烟水依泉谷，川陆散樵渔。\n忽念故园日，复忆骊山居。\n荏苒斑鬓及，梦寝婚宦初。\n不觉平生事，咄嗟二纪余。\n存殁阔已永，悲多欢自疎。\n高秩非爲美，阑干泪盈裾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}